            "id": 1196974,
            "title": "沙田花園逾千呎單位連車位3.5萬租出",
            "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">坐擁低密度綠意環境的沙田花園，以清幽寧靜的居住氛圍著稱，屋苑單位實用率高，空間感十足，加上附設專屬車位，生活配套齊備，向來深受追求高品質生活的優質租客喜愛。利嘉閣地產沙田-新城市分行高級分區董事馮澤源表示，該行團隊精英最新促成沙田花園H座中層2室連車位的二手租務成交個案，面積約1,294呎，採三房一套連工人房間隔及一車位。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">馮澤源透露，新租客為本地客，早前透過利嘉閣真盤源平台獲安排參觀上述放盤。客人極為心儀屋苑環境寧靜舒適，加上單位開則大氣且空間感十足，極為符合優質家庭居住需求，睇樓後感到十分滿意，為表誠意主動提出年繳42萬租金，即以月租3.5萬元承租上址，折合實用面積呎租約27.05元，較市價低約10%。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left; margin: 0px; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">據悉，業主於2017年以約1,050萬元購入上述單位，現可享約4厘租金回報。</span></p>",
